  <prompt>Write docs/architecture/SPAARKE-MCP-SERVER-ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/guides/HOW-TO-ADD-AN-MCP-TOOL.md from the implemented code, link them and 042's connector runbook from docs/INDEX.md, replace the retired term 'Spaarke Copilot' in M365-COPILOT-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md, and leave doc-drift-audit clean.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert technical writer for Spaarke architecture and operational guides.</role>
  <goal>The architecture doc and how-to guide exist, name only real files, link the runbook, and doc-drift-audit reports no stale reference in them.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-18; naming note §1 ('Spaarke Copilot' retired; it appears at docs/guides/M365-COPILOT-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md:33). The connector runbook is authored in 042; this task links and audits it.</background>
    <relevant-files>
