  <justification>
    <existing>docs/guides/M365-COPILOT-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md (April agent); design.md (project-local, pre-implementation); no MCP architecture doc or tool guide exists in docs/ (grep -ril 'mcp' docs/architecture returns no server doc).</existing>
    <extension>No: the April guide covers a different surface and design.md is a project artifact that is not maintained after close.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>The next area (billing review, Patents) has no maintained description of the host, auth or tool conventions, and a second MCP server could be built by mistake (risk R9).</cost-of-doing-nothing>
